  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Divine_Soothsayer.jpg\" title=\"Divine Soothsayer\"><img alt=\"Divine Soothsayer\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/Divine_Soothsayer.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Divine_Soothsayer.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Divine Soothsayer</div></div></div>\n<p>These multi-armed supernatural creatures cast bolts of elemental damage.  They are often found in the company of similarly themed elemental knights.  These creatures can not only predict the future, but can also heal themselves and nearby allies.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Revenant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embercore Prophetess\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadowspawn Blood Priestess\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/HDoL\" title=\"HDoL\">HDoL</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Soothsayer\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Oracle\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GoS] dark oracle\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\"